-// sandbox profiles are plan C10.
+// Layout: the helper is OpenArcCore.framework/Versions/A/Helpers/
+// Open Arc Helper<suffix>.app/Contents/MacOS/Open Arc Helper<suffix> and the
+// library is Versions/A/OpenArcCore, four directories up from the executable's
